  "theoretical_contribution": "This study advances the theoretical understanding of the relationship between model interpretability and decision-making effectiveness by empirically validating the mediating role of user trust and perceived transparency in high-stakes healthcare contexts. It proposes a causal chain linking interpretable LLMs to improved decision accuracy through enhanced user trust.",
